{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107757","id":2607062200,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bZJy4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107757","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107757.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107757.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107757","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107757/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107757/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107757/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/647cd51771423d4f3486d9f53d1ca2536106b01c","number":107757,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Create scene thumbnails on thread when using Compatibility renderer","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #107736 \r\n\r\nThis PR enforces scene thumbnails to be created on thread when using Compatibility renderer (Forward, Mobile renderer already does since PR #102313)\r\n\r\nAlso fixes crashes due to problematic resource freeing at:\r\n```c++\r\n// editor/plugins/editor_preview_plugins.cpp:534\r\n\r\n// Prepare for gui render\r\ncallable_mp((Node *)sub_viewport, &Node::remove_child).call_deferred(p_scene);\r\np_scene->queue_free();\r\n```\r\n\r\nCrashes happens randomly and rewriting this part of code to not free the ```p_scene``` early solves it, see changes in this PR commit. Can possibly fix some random crashes users are having recently.\r\n\r\n### Note (1)\r\nThe decision to make thumbnail creation on main thread when running Compatibility renderer is some comment (removed after PR #102313) suggested we should obey:\r\n\r\n**drivers/gles3/rasterizer_gles3.h:137**\r\n```c++\r\n_ALWAYS_INLINE_ bool can_create_resources_async() const { return false; }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere's no deep explanation about this, it is just set to false. But after testing various projects running thumbnail creation on thread, I currently don't run into any issues. Mind someone at rendering team can explain the purpose of this boolean, what action is it intended to stop us from doing?\r\n\r\n### Note (2)\r\nThe single-threaded part of code is remain untouched, I think we can open another PR to clean them up if this PR is approved to become stable. We can simply search for all occurrences of ```can_run_on_thread()``` and ```is_threaded()``` and remove them.\r\n\r\n### Note (3)\r\nWe leave other non-critical improvements to #107689\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nTest project and results (video is sped up 4x):\r\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20827669/test.zip)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64f2fa5c-c448-4a19-ae5b-bbac1bc0e2eb\r\n\r\nAnd another project of mine that runs compatibility renderer, the created thumbnails:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11909e48-97f5-487e-b9ac-d415e6b19664)\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1161726405,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTYxNzI2NDA1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/high%20priority","name":"high priority","description":"","color":"7956a5","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-20T10:49:10Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T09:46:28Z","closed_at":"2025-06-21T09:41:34Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ca5dc318249b8c7c3a75b2b25083eec1087fe24d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"daniel080400:thumbnail_compatibility_threaded","ref":"thumbnail_compatibility_threaded","repo":{"id":925109860,"node_id":"R_kgDONyQOZA","name":"godot","full_name":"daniel080400/godot","owner":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","follo